Happy Saint-Nicholas day to all who celebrate (or those who celebrated last night)! I wanted to do something themed for the holiday and it still be useful in general. Sinterklaas always arrives on a boat here in Belgium, so I made the two captains who bring him here safely.
I figure some modern(ish) captains could be useful to you all
And what is a cruise on the open waters if you’re not behested by pirates? According to a legend (thank you Avery for pointing this out), Sinterklaas once entangled with pirates. And since both
@Finnuval
and
@OmnislashXX
asked for pirate stuff, consider this your gift from Sinterklaas.
We've got a captain with some variations, a sailor (I wonder if anyone can spot where he's from) and a marine/navy soldier. (Someone's gotta hunt down those pirates right?
)
And here's a quick edit of the default ship sprite:
Now your pirates can sail around your world map with black sails.
I'm posting a bit early as I have a busy day tomorrow with the celebrations (and also I am already completely fatigued
). For those who celebrate Saint-Nicholas: what did you get this year?

