Just a Sci-Fi Girl
Last year I made some extra fantasy and modern kids. My initial idea was to also make some sci-fi kids to go with the default resources
.
Upon inspection I felt like the default SF is like 90% modern, and I was running out of time, so I switched to something else instead.
Still I wanted to really make them for this year's, the only issue was well what do people and especially kids wear in sci-fi? And also what type of SF is the most popular? Something like Star Trek or something more fantastical like Star Wars? I decided I didn't want to do military like uniforms for the kids, or medieval peasant garb recolored like Star Wars does
.
So I ended up searching for avant garde fashion as well as alt street fashion to get some inspiration. I hope you like her!
Would people prefer I post the SF boy next or another fairy or something else entirely? I don't have much of a schedule this time around, so let me know what you want to see next.

@ATT_Turan
Ooooh no, I did watch The Neverending Story as a child and I didn't like it and never watched it again lol. I should give it a rewatch at some point. Glad you liked the style I picked. Not sure if I'll do more yet (besides the ones I've already done of course).
