Thank you! Agreed, there's not much out there and I believe it's mostly due to not knowing what sort of style to go with. There's just a ton more references for modern, fantasy medieval and even other time periods out there. I went back and checked the (futuristic) SF games I've played and even there it's just modern (black), athletic and military style. Apologies for my rambling.
